C3cQ3IcHCHsoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["菜單很多種 不想吃飯\n點了泡菜烏龍麵拉麵另外加玉米\n整個麵都是滷肉肉燥的味道甜甜的\n完全沒有泡菜味 單吃泡菜也是\n\n五星給在食材跟店員態度親切.環境座位舒適\n外面掛已打烊 詢問後是擔心食材部分賣完\n還是讓我點了餐\n座位走道空間夠.音樂.音響不錯\n叉燒肉本身很厚是好吃的\n豆芽菜份量大概1/3碗多補足了一點菜量\n烏龍麵本身是貴的那種透明QQ的\n\n吃完料喝湯還是肉燥味 很甜跟泡菜微酸\n總結就是肉燥可能不要拌進去\n拌進去完全是肉燥湯麵味😂\n真的是台式拉麵",null,[0,41]]]],[],[null,null,5683,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvNFZsSTVPWGw0YW5OQk1ISmlZWGx0TXpWdmJrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xda28f8c1a1b487aa!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlo4VlI5OXl4anNBMHJiYXltMzVvbkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvNFZsSTVPWGw0YW5OQk1ISmlZWGx0TXpWdmJrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvNFZsSTVPWGw0YW5OQk1ISmlZWGx0TXpWdmJrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvNFZsSTVPWGw0YW5OQk1ISmlZWGx0TXpWdmJrRRILMGNaVHd5VDBCUTEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sbzRWbEk1T1hsNGFuTkJNSEppWVhsdE16VnZia0USCzBjWlR3eVQwQlExIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARqoe0ocH4KNoqCzBjWlR3eVQwQlEx\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjttfOfzNKWAxWtiq8BHa1bC3cQoykIfSgK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjvwvqfzNKWAxVveV4EHeTpKzEQ0pMFCCUoAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjttfOfzNKWAxWtiq8BHa1bC3cQ0pMFCGwoAg"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN0aTV1djRBRRAB",["0x0:0xda28f8c1a1b487aa",null,1706745455470021,1706745637234679,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113358545358625442616/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["尼克尼克","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJlBWgJdVCYE7BekdW1JzPJcIW9HqQFk7AObteSU-EZYvb--g\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113358545358625442616?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"113358545358625442616",null,552,2605,null,[1,8,1],1,["在地嚮導 · 552 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjttfOfzNKWAxWtiq8BHa1bC3cQpr8GCH8oAA"]]]],null,"2 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],